power-monitor (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Ubuntu 24.04 amd64 package.
  * Offline venv creation from a bundled wheelhouse.
  * Dedicated system user, read-only RAPL helper and scoped sudoers rule.
  * systemd service enabled on installation.
  * Hardware diagnostics written to /var/lib/power-monitor/hardware-report.txt.

